      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 2.993,
          "en": "So with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.993,
          "end": 5.04,
          "en": "we're storing all these answers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.04,
          "end": 8.07,
          "en": "but now we also must make sure that at a certain point",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.07,
          "end": 10.912,
          "en": "of time we don't continue presenting questions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.912,
          "end": 14.67,
          "en": "because otherwise we'll run into an error again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.67,
          "end": 16.89,
          "en": "once we run out of questions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.89,
          "end": 19.92,
          "en": "And to make sure that we don't reach this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.92,
          "end": 23.43,
          "en": "we can actually use this selectedAnswers list here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.43,
          "end": 25.71,
          "en": "to find out at which point of time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.71,
          "end": 28.743,
          "en": "we have actually answered all available questions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.36,
          "end": 34.59,
          "en": "Because of course here, we add one answer per question",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.59,
          "end": 36.66,
          "en": "to selectedAnswers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.66,
          "end": 38.31,
          "en": "Initially it's an empty list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.31,
          "end": 41.1,
          "en": "and at some point it will have as many answers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.1,
          "end": 43.383,
          "en": "as we have questions in this app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.58,
          "end": 46.53,
          "en": "Therefore, what we can do inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.53,
          "end": 48.78,
          "en": "of this chooseAnswer question here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.78,
          "end": 50.61,
          "en": "is we can add a if statement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.61,
          "end": 53.52,
          "en": "about which you learned a little bit earlier already,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.52,
          "end": 56.421,
          "en": "and compare the length of selectedAnswers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.421,
          "end": 58.74,
          "en": "to the length of questions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.74,
          "end": 62.16,
          "en": "And if the two are equal, we know that we have answered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.16,
          "end": 64.95,
          "en": "as many questions as we have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.95,
          "end": 69.51,
          "en": "So it's then at this point of time where we should stop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.51,
          "end": 71.78999999999999,
          "en": "So to make that comparison here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.78999999999999,
          "end": 74.82,
          "en": "we can access selectedAnswers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.82,
          "end": 78.03,
          "en": "And then on this list object here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.03,
          "end": 80.16,
          "en": "we got various utility properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.16,
          "end": 81.96000000000001,
          "en": "and methods as you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 81.96000000000001,
          "end": 84.661,
          "en": "For example, we have a length property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.661,
          "end": 89.43299999999999,
          "en": "which gives us the amount of items stored in that list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.66,
          "end": 95.66,
          "en": "And we can check if that is equal to questions.length.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.19,
          "end": 99.42,
          "en": "Now, for this, we must make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.42,
          "end": 103.89,
          "en": "that the questions defined in this questions.dart file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.89,
          "end": 106.35,
          "en": "are available in this quiz.dart file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106.35,
          "end": 108.63,
          "en": "And that's of course done by importing them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.63,
          "end": 111.63,
          "en": "by importing from package:adv_basics.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.63,
          "end": 113.88,
          "en": "And then there from the data folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.88,
          "end": 116.253,
          "en": "and there from questions.dart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.71000000000001,
          "end": 123.63,
          "en": "With that, we import this list of questions from that file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.63,
          "end": 127.53,
          "en": "And in quiz.dart, we can now compare these two lengths",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.53,
          "end": 131.19,
          "en": "and if they are equal, we know that we ran out of questions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.19,
          "end": 134.31,
          "en": "So that's when we wanna switch to the results screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.31,
          "end": 136.95,
          "en": "At the moment, I have no results screen though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.95,
          "end": 139.17000000000002,
          "en": "therefore, right now I simply wanna switch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 139.17000000000002,
          "end": 140.553,
          "en": "back to the start screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.39,
          "end": 144.84,
          "en": "Hence, in here we can call setState",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 144.84,
          "end": 147.75,
          "en": "to trigger the build method again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 147.75,
          "end": 150.76,
          "en": "And in this anonymous function which we pass to setState,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.76,
          "end": 155.76,
          "en": "we can set the activeScreen back to startScreen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.832,
          "end": 158.85,
          "en": "to make sure that we show the startScreen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 158.85,
          "end": 162.183,
          "en": "instead of an error once we ran out of questions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 163.56,
          "end": 167.57999999999998,
          "en": "With that, if you save this and force the app to reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 167.57999999999998,
          "end": 169.53,
          "en": "you should be able to start the quiz",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.53,
          "end": 173.43,
          "en": "and answer these questions by picking any answers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.43,
          "end": 174.39,
          "en": "But once you're done,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174.39,
          "end": 176.37,
          "en": "you're back here on the starting screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 176.37,
          "end": 179.46,
          "en": "instead of getting that error, which we got before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 179.46,
          "end": 181.2,
          "en": "Now what you'll notice is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 181.2,
          "end": 183.63,
          "en": "that if you now start the quiz again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 183.63,
          "end": 185.49,
          "en": "and you go through all questions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 185.49,
          "end": 188.37,
          "en": "you will get this error screen again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 188.37,
          "end": 189.39,
          "en": "And we get this error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 189.39,
          "end": 192.84,
          "en": "because we don't reset our selectedAnswers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 192.84,
          "end": 196.14,
          "en": "Therefore, we'll actually have more answers than questions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 196.14,
          "end": 198.57,
          "en": "And this condition will never be met again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 198.57,
          "end": 200.88,
          "en": "after it was met for the first time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 200.88,
          "end": 202.17000000000002,
          "en": "And we could work around that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 202.17000000000002,
          "end": 205.07999999999998,
          "en": "by simply resetting our selectedAnswers",
