        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 205.07999999999998,
          "end": 207.3,
          "en": "back to an empty list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 207.3,
          "end": 211.23,
          "en": "For this, we now just have to switch from final to var,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 211.23,
          "end": 213.27,
          "en": "or since I'm defining a type here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 213.27,
          "end": 215.872,
          "en": "actually just remove final since this will then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 215.872,
          "end": 218.79,
          "en": "automatically turn this back to a variable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 218.79,
          "end": 221.37,
          "en": "Because we can only set this to a new value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 221.37,
          "end": 225.24,
          "en": "with the equal sign operator if this is a variable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 225.24,
          "end": 227.16,
          "en": "That's what I mentioned before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 227.16,
          "end": 229.92000000000002,
          "en": "So with this switched back to a variable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 229.92000000000002,
          "end": 232.238,
          "en": "once we exhausted our questions here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 232.238,
          "end": 236.313,
          "en": "we should reset selectedAnswers back to an empty list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 238.02,
          "end": 240.09,
          "en": "And with that, if you now save this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 240.09,
          "end": 244.08,
          "en": "and force a restart, you can start the quiz again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 244.08,
          "end": 246.51,
          "en": "go through all questions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 246.51,
          "end": 248.19,
          "en": "And if you now start again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 248.19,
